---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import config from "../../site.config";
---
<Base title="Privacy" description="What Property Desk records. Almost nothing: the calculator runs entirely in your browser." path="/privacy">
  <div class="col" style="padding-block: var(--space-l) var(--space-xl);">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>

    <h2 style="margin-top: var(--space-l);">The calculator</h2>
    <p style="margin-top: var(--space-s);">
      Every figure you type stays in your browser. The price, the loan, the
      commission you negotiated: none of it is sent anywhere, because there is
      nowhere for it to be sent. This site is a set of static files with no
      server to receive a form and no database behind it.
    </p>
    <p>
      That is worth stating plainly, because what you enter here would tell
      somebody what you are about to buy and what you can afford.
    </p>

    <h2 style="margin-top: var(--space-l);">What is recorded</h2>
    <p style="margin-top: var(--space-s);">
      There is no account, no sign-in, no comment form and no newsletter. We set
      no advertising cookies and run no advertising trackers.
    </p>
    <p>
      Our host records ordinary web server logs, including IP addresses, in order
      to serve the site and absorb abuse. We do not combine those with anything
      else and do not use them to identify anyone.
    </p>

    <h2 style="margin-top: var(--space-l);">Your rights</h2>
    <p style="margin-top: var(--space-s);">
      Under the UAE Personal Data Protection Law you may ask what is held about
      you, and ask for it to be corrected or deleted. Since this site collects
      nothing from you directly, in practice there is nothing of yours here to
      return.
    </p>
    <p class="meta" style="margin-top: var(--space-l);">
      If that changes, this page changes with it, and the date it changed will be
      on it.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
